              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son of man, What is the vine tree more than any tree,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or than",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a branch which is among the trees of the forest?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall wood be taken thereof to do any work? or will",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "take a pin of it to hang any vessel thereon?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, it is cast into the fire for fuel; the fire devoureth both the ends of it, and the midst of it is burned. Is it meet for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "work?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, when it was whole, it was meet for no work: how much less shall it be meet yet for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "work, when the fire hath devoured it, and it is burned?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; As the vine tree among the trees of the forest, which I have given to the fire for fuel, so will I give the inhabitants of Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will set my face against them; they shall go out from",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fire, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "another",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fire shall devour them; and ye shall know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I set my face against them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will make the land desolate, because they have committed a trespass, saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
